  "hasDescription": [
    {
      "@id": "https://data.datatourisme.fr/5e6fe549-6972-3ae0-b70f-73545a16aa55",
      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          "Machen Sie sich darauf gefasst, in Candlelight von den betörenden Klängen eines Streichquartetts mitgerissen zu werden.\nAuf dem Programm stehen :\nI Want To Break Free\nWe Will Rock You\nSomebody To Love\nRadio Gaga\nDon't Stop Me Now\nKiller Queen\nCrazy Little Thing\nWho Wants To Live Forever\nBohemian Rhapsody\nLove Of My Life\nWe Are The Champions\nAnother One Bites The Dust"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Prepare to be swept away by the mesmerizing sounds of a string quartet at Candlelight.\nOn the program:\nI Want To Break Free\nWe Will Rock You\nSomebody To Love\nRadio Gaga\nDon't Stop Me Now\nKiller Queen\nCrazy Little Thing\nWho Wants To Live Forever\nBohemian Rhapsody\nLove Of My Life\nWe Are The Champions\nAnother One Bites The Dust"
        ],
        "it": [
          "Preparatevi a essere travolti dai suoni incantevoli di un quartetto d'archi a Candlelight.\nIl programma comprende\nVoglio liberarmi\nWe Will Rock You\nQualcuno da amare\nRadio Gaga\nDon't Stop Me Now\nRegina assassina\nPiccola cosa pazza\nChi vuole vivere per sempre\nBohemian Rhapsody\nL'amore della mia vita\nSiamo i campioni\nUn altro morde la polvere"
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Préparez-vous à être emporté par les sons envoûtants d'un quatuor à cordes à Candlelight. \nAu programme : \nI Want To Break Free\nWe Will Rock You\nSomebody To Love\nRadio Gaga\nDon't Stop Me Now\nKiller Queen\nCrazy Little Thing\nWho Wants To Live Forever\nBohemian Rhapsody\nLove Of My Life\nWe Are The Champions\nAnother One Bites The Dust"
        ],
        "es": [
          "Prepárese para dejarse llevar por los encantadores sonidos de un cuarteto de cuerda a la luz de las velas.\nEl programa incluye\nQuiero liberarme\nWe Will Rock You\nAlguien a quien amar\nRadio Gaga\nDon't Stop Me Now\nKiller Queen\nCrazy Little Thing\nWho Wants To Live Forever\nBohemian Rhapsody\nLove Of My Life\nWe Are The Champions\nAnother One Bites The Dust"
        ],
        "nl": [
          "Laat je meeslepen door de betoverende klanken van een strijkkwartet bij Candlelight.\nOp het programma staat\nIk wil vrij breken\nWe zullen je wiegen\nIemand om van te houden\nRadio Gaga\nStop me nu niet\nKoningin moordenaar\nGek klein ding\nWie wil voor altijd leven\nBohemian Rhapsody\nLiefde van mijn leven\nWe zijn de kampioenen\nEen ander bijt in het stof"
        ]
      },
